 flash, HDR (photo/panorama)"},{"label":"Video Recording","value":"4K@24/25/30/60/100/120fps, 1080p@25/30/60/120/240fps, 10-bit HDR, Dolby Vision HDR (up to 120fps), ProRes, ProRes RAW (up to 120fps), Apple Log 2, 3D (spatial) video/audio, stereo sound rec."}]},{"group":"Front Camera","items":[{"label":"Resolution","value":"18 MP multi-aspect, f/1.9, 20mm (ultrawide), PDAF SL 3D, (depth/biometrics sensor)"},{"label":"Features","value":"HDR, Dolby Vision HDR, 3D (spatial) audio, stereo sound rec., ProRes RAW, Apple Log 2"},{"label":"Video Recording","value":"4K@24/25/30/60fps, 1080p@25/30/60/120fps, gyro-EIS"}]},{"group":"Audio","items":[{"label":"Speaker","value":"Stereo Speaker"}]},{"group":"Network & Connectivity","items":[{"label":"SIM","value":"Nano-SIM + eSIM + eSIM (max 2 at a time; International) eSIM + eSIM (8 or more, max 2 at a time; USA) Nano-SIM + Nano-SIM (China)"},{"label":"Network","value":"5G, 4G, 3G, 2G"},{"label":"Wi-Fi","value":"Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/6e/7, tri-band, hotspot"},{"label":"Bluetooth","value":"Bluetooth 6.0, A2DP, LE"},{"label":"GPS","value":"GPS (L1+L5), GLONASS, GALILEO, BDS, QZSS, NavIC"},{"label":"NFC","value":"Yes"},{"label":"USB","value":"USB Type-C 3.2 Gen 2, DisplayPort"},{"label":"Audio Jack","value":"N/A"}]},{"group":"OS","items":[{"label":"Operating System","value":"iOS 27"}]},{"group":"Features","items":[{"label":"Sensors","value":"Face ID, accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass, barometer Ultra Wideband (UWB) support (gen2 chip) Emergency SOS, Messages and Find My via satellite Enabled by TrueDepth technology in the Center Stage front camera LiDAR Scanner High dynamic range gyro High-g accelerometer Proximity sensor Dual ambient light sensors Barometer Crash Detection Roadside Assistance via satellite"},{"label":"IP Rating","value":"IP68 dust tight and water resistant (immersible up to 6m for 30 min)"},{"label":"Other Features","value":"Apple Pay (Visa, MasterCard, AMEX certified)"}]},{"group":"Battery","items":[{"label